<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Fairfax magazine editor resigns.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Fairfax magazine editor resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newspaper publisher John Fairfax Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday the editor of its Good Weekend magazine, Anne Summers, had resigned to pursue writing interests.</p>
<p>Fairfax chief executive Robert Muscat said he had accepted the resignation with regret and had thanked her for her part in achieving record profits for the magazine.</p>
<p>The colour magazine is issued with the Saturday editions of Fairfax's Sydney Morning Herald and The Age newspapers.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
